{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17218070","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17218070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1721807001:1":{"text":"Something's gone wrong in the central plaza!","source_cn":"中央广场出大事了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A11BB628F34EA3B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1721807002:1":{"text":"I hear it's about the Hall of Ancients.","source_cn":"听说跟圣古堂有关","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBC8850CDB57631D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1721807003:1":{"text":"The guards are rushing there...","source_cn":"去了好多守备军……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x55B9FE55E11F6EAA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1721807004:1":{"text":"I'm steering clear of that area.","source_cn":"那我还是不去凑热闹了","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1DB87C66BEAE0C7D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1721807005:1":{"text":"The Hall of Ancients... is back?","source_cn":"圣古堂……回来了？在这种时候？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA79EC2C6214E20EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1721807006:1":{"text":"Peggy and Cassadee might have returned as well...","source_cn":"如果是这样，那佩吉和科丝蒂是不是也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB90C245130FAC521","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1721807007:1":{"text":"And Father... A full-scale mobilization means the situation is dire.","source_cn":"还有父亲，全军出动意味着那边的情况可能极其不稳定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE7FEAF58176EFB9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1721807008:1":{"text":"... But I'm already set for Ashvale County. If Father sees me back now, he'll surely take me to task again for ignoring orders.","source_cn":"……我已经决定要去灰影郡了。现在回头，要是被父亲看到，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2DF9CB4CADB0D1F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1721807009:1":{"text":"As much as Gwyneth tries to persuade herself to get back on track, her body has other ideas.","source_cn":"格温妮丝试图说服自己继续赶路，但身体却诚实地僵在原地。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB7EE0FF1A1A66DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1721807010:1":{"text":"... It won't hurt to take a quick look, right?","source_cn":"……不行！我就去看一眼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5B15149468BC112","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1721807011:1":{"text":"I'm still the captain of the First Division. Although I've been assigned to Ashvale County, I remain in service to Savannah until I leave.","source_cn":"毕竟我是第一分队的队长，虽然接了调令，但在正式离开前，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8802756DD5B2C42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1721807012:1":{"text":"I-I can step in if the guards need help—that's it! I'll leave as soon as I know Peggy is safe!","source_cn":"万一其他人处理不好现场，我也能……我也能帮把手。对，就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA67417EB5DC0E1DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1721807013:1":{"text":"Gwyneth turns around, pushing against the flow of the crowd...","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB739AA0BC11A0FD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:15:1721807014:1":{"text":"Once again, she plunges back into the eye of the storm!","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92D7092B9F37DCF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贵族1":{"text":"Lady A","source":"贵族1","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speake